cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper and identify the version used."
title: "A Hadamard matrix of order 15896"
version: "0.1.0"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kline
    given-names: Jeffery
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - Hadamard matrices
  - conference matrices
  - Williamson-type matrices
abstract: >-
  A fixed pairing in the Cooper–Wallis design of order 12 works for four
  Williamson-type matrices of any common positive odd order. The paired-block
  conference construction gives real Hadamard matrices of orders 15896,
  18008, 18296 and 23096. The software constructs a matrix of order 15896 and
  checks every pair of distinct rows of the packed certificate.
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/hadamard-order-15896"
